    "detailed_description": "Commander!<br />\r\nYou find yourself sheltered with some survivors in a former nuclear power plant after some serious events that befell humanity in the new century.<br />\r\nManage the factory, obtain resources to make different types of boxes to fool bandits, send expeditions to find everything you can, repair work areas, face enemies to defend your facilities, deploy drones and radio controlled cars to Secure the perimeter and find items after battles and prepare for special events.<br />\r\nThis and much more in a great management game. It's our story!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nShelter Survivors<br />\r\nHunt other commanders in events<br />\r\nAvoid being sabotaged by denying entry to enemies<br />\r\nSend drops to other players<br />\r\nYour mood will be reflected in the sun<br />\r\nReal time management<br />\r\nAnd thousands of other things! Discover them!",
